  "description": "Hye-Su and Kang-Ho meet at a film club.\nKang-Ho, dreaming of becoming a successful actor, spends his days obsessed with auditions and drinking, relying on Hye-Su for support. Seeking to understand Kang-Ho, Hye-Su begins acting lessons and gradually begins to forge her own path. However, upon learning that Kang-Ho landed a role by sleeping with a staff member, Hye-Su leaves him and hatches a plan for revenge.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=843866), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13253015)",
